---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About">
  <h1>About Straat Mag</h1>
  <p>
    Straat Mag is a weekly online intelligence magazine for South African entrepreneurs. We cover
    public procurement money flows, government and private funding, entrepreneurship competitions,
    and capital-raising strategy.
  </p>
  <p>
    Straat Mag is researched with AI and edited by humans. Every figure in every article is checked
    against a public source before publication, and every factual article lists its sources at the
    bottom. If we cannot verify a story, we do not run it.
  </p>
</Base>
